---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="mt-auto border-t border-gh-border py-10">
  <div class="gh-container flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    <div class="space-y-2">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm text-gh-muted">
        © {year} git-grasp · MIT
      </p>
      <p class="max-w-xl text-xs leading-relaxed text-gh-muted">
        Site analytics (when configured) are cookieless. The playground will send queries/results
        to improve search after Start. The CLI is local-first with optional opt-in analytics (off by default) — see
        <a href="/privacy" class="text-gh-accent hover:underline">Privacy &amp; legal</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
    <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm" aria-label="Footer">
      <a href="/examples" class="text-gh-muted hover:text-gh-fg">Examples</a>
      <a href="/#faq" class="text-gh-muted hover:text-gh-fg">FAQ</a>
      <a href="/privacy" class="text-gh-muted hover:text-gh-fg">Privacy &amp; legal</a>
      <a
        href="https://github.com/NuclearManatee/git-grasp"
        class="text-gh-muted hover:text-gh-fg"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        target="_blank"
      >
        GitHub
      </a>
      <a href="/#install" class="text-gh-muted hover:text-gh-fg">Install</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
